WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.743
Module 8 moves from query structure to value
transformation You

00:00:05.769 --> 00:00:12.547
will work with text functions pattern matching dates
timestamps and date arithmetic The

00:00:12.574 --> 00:00:17.587
subquery ideas from this module will continue to be
useful because real queries often combine

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:23.123
nested logic with transformations Before moving on
make sure you

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:27.742
can explain what the inner query returns and why the
outer operator matches that result
